          "annotations": [],
          "text": "{\n  \"contract_version\": \"results-document-v2\",\n  \"selection\": {\n    \"journey_ids\": [],\n    \"benchmark_observation_id\": \"C1\",\n    \"incomplete_observation_ids\": [\n      \"A2\",\n      \"A3\",\n      \"A275\",\n      \"A137\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"narrative\",\n      \"text\": \"I couldn’t identify a complete eligible award itinerary from San Francisco (SFO) to Bangkok (BKK) for January 2027. The award results below are incomplete leads, not end-to-end booking options: they don’t provide flight schedules or enough detail to assess connections and total travel time. As a separate cash baseline, the January 1 search returned this SFO–BKK fare:\",\n      \"reference_kind\": null,\n      \"reference_id\": null,\n      \"label\": null,\n      \"claims\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"reference\",\n      \"text\": \"A cash quote for the requested SFO–BKK route—not an award option.\",\n      \"reference_kind\": \"benchmark\",\n      \"reference_id\": \"C1\",\n      \"label\": \"SFO–BKK cash baseline\",\n      \"claims\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"narrative\",\n      \"text\": \"That quote departs at 10:55 p.m. on January 1 and arrives at 10:35 a.m. on January 4, taking 44 hours 40 minutes. Its displayed fare is $640, but the price scope is unknown, so it should not be treated as a confirmed per-traveler or party total. The award leads also show unknown price scope; their points are in different programs and should not be compared as if they were interchangeable.\",\n      \"reference_kind\": null,\n      \"reference_id\": null,\n      \"label\": null,\n      \"claims\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"narrative\",\n      \"text\": \"For January 1, the United and Alaska search results both point to economy awards on the requested route. They may be worth checking if you have miles in the relevant program, but neither has a complete schedule here, so there is no basis to compare arrival time, total duration, or connection arrangements.\",\n      \"reference_kind\": null,\n      \"reference_id\": null,\n      \"label\": null,\n      \"claims\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"reference\",\n      \"text\": \"A January 1 SFO–BKK economy award lead; no complete flight schedule or price scope is established.\",\n      \"reference_kind\": \"lead\",\n      \"reference_id\": \"A2\",\n      \"label\": \"United economy lead\",\n      \"claims\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"reference\",\n      \"text\": \"A January 1 SFO–BKK economy award lead; no complete flight schedule or price scope is established.\",\n      \"reference_kind\": \"lead\",\n      \"reference_id\": \"A3\",\n      \"label\": \"Alaska economy lead\",\n      \"claims\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"narrative\",\n      \"text\": \"Another possibility to investigate is routing through Taipei (TPE), where the search found an SFO–TPE economy lead and a separate TPE–BKK business lead. The business-class result changes the cabin choice, but it is dated January 2 and does not establish a connection from San Francisco. These component observations do not show compatible flight times, a protected connection, or a complete trip price; if considering separately booked flights, confirm the connection feasibility and what protection, if any, applies.\",\n      \"reference_kind\": null,\n      \"reference_id\": null,\n      \"label\": null,\n      \"claims\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"reference\",\n      \"text\": \"An SFO–TPE economy award lead dated January 1; not a confirmed connection to Bangkok.\",\n      \"reference_kind\": \"lead\",\n      \"reference_id\": \"A275\",\n      \"label\": \"Taipei positioning lead\",\n      \"claims\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"reference\",\n      \"text\": \"A TPE–BKK business award lead dated January 2; no schedule or connection from SFO is established.\",\n      \"reference_kind\": \"lead\",\n      \"reference_id\": \"A137\",\n      \"label\": \"Taipei–Bangkok business lead\",\n      \"claims\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"narrative\",\n      \"text\": \"These search observations were recorded on October 9, 2026, not in real time. Confirm award space, schedules, connection arrangements, and full pricing with the relevant providers before making plans. The wider eligible inventory is available in the independent explorer; nearby date variants add little while the end-to-end details remain missing.\",\n      \"reference_kind\": null,\n      \"reference_id\": null,\n      \"label\": null,\n      \"claims\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}",
